      <span class="kicker">Scientific scripting language · specification</span>
      <h1><span class="q">Qu</span> — write the math,<br>watch it move.</h1>
      <p class="lead">A draft language where signal processing, data science, machine learning, and
        animated visualization share one readable syntax — and one clean path to fast CPU and GPU backends.
        Every demo below is a live drawing of what the code beside it produces.</p>
